2
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:08,033
The flight was cancelled blank the bad weather: a noun phrase follows, so a preposition: because of.

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:15,364
Blank the weather was bad, the flight was cancelled: a full clause at the front, so a conjunction: because.

4
00:00:15,364 --> 00:00:26,666
The weather was bad, semicolon, blank, comma, the flight was cancelled: a semicolon before and a comma after means a discourse marker: therefore.

